        {
          "text": "Sulemani Daudi mvi isu okpo erini opi nyaria, te Yehova Mungu eriniri ovu eri be, ’ba eri ru uru inzizaru ambo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
